<title>CANADA: Stampeder mails bid for Morgan.</title>
<headline>Stampeder mails bid for Morgan.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stampeder Exploration Ltd said on Tuesday it mailed its takeover bid to Morgan Hydrocarbons Inc shareholders, giving holders until 1300 EDT (1700 GMT) on October 10 to decide.</p>
<p>It has offered C$4.75 in cash or 0.85 of a Stampeder common share, subject to pro-rating. The bid is subject to certain conditions including a minimum tender of 66-2/3 percent of Morgan's shares, Stampeder said.</p>
<p>Morgan said on September 14 said its board would recommend that shareholders accept Stampeder's offer.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
